  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 3 herbs</p>\n<p>This tonic grants the imbiber a +2 competence bonus to Diplomacy and Bluff checks. This bonus increases by 2 for every 5 ranks you possess in the sphere’s associated skill.</p>\n<p><strong>Twists</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1 bland herb:</strong> The bonus from this tonic also applies to Sense Motive checks. Additionally, when you create this tonic, you can choose to halve the bonuses the tonic grants and change the tonic’s bonus types to an alchemical bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>1 spicy herb:</strong> The bonus from this tonic also applies to Intimidate checks.</li>\n<li><strong>1 cool herb:</strong> Whenever the imbiber modifies a creature’s attitude using Diplomacy (or Intimidate if this tonic has the spicy twist), the attitude adjustment is increased by one step.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/herbalism#toc34\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
